      "language": "en",
      "application_deadline": null,
      "content": "&lt;p&gt;We’re seeking AI &amp;amp; People Transformation Interns to help reimagine how our People teams work. You’ll examine how process design, data, and emerging AI tools can help simplify and improve everyday experiences for employees, managers, recruiters, and People team partners.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Based in our New York City office and working within the People PMO, you’ll partner with mentors, project leaders, People teams, and IT to map operational workflows, identify friction points and opportunities for AI or automation, and help assess or test practical solutions. We’re looking for interns who bring a fresh perspective, look for opportunities to rethink existing workflows, and connect ideas across projects. The work is transformation-focused: looking beyond existing processes to redesign work thoughtfully and build improvements that can scale.&lt;/p&gt;",
