      "application_deadline": null,
      "content": "&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone to join our talent acquisition team as a Contract Corporate Recruiter who can help us grow.. While we’re growing fast, we’re still very hands-on so you should be a proven day-to-day tactical recruiter, but also be able to provide guidance in the development of the overall recruiting strategy for our North America Corporate hiring efforts.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor to hiring managers across the corporate function, partnering with them on everything from setting data-driven recruiting strategies to closing candidates&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Develop sourcing strategies to generate a sufficient pipeline, using a variety of innovative techniques including social networking and direct sourcing&lt;/li&gt;",
