      "language": "en",
      "application_deadline": null,
      "content": "&lt;p&gt;The Candidate Experience team creates a candidate experience that is human, transparent, equitable, and effortless, regardless of who the candidate is, what role they are interviewing for, or where they are in the process. As a Candidate Experience Coordinator, you will help bring this vision to life by coordinating thoughtful, efficient, and consistent interview experiences for candidates while partnering closely with recruiters, hiring teams, and interviewers.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This role can be based out of our office or remotely in the United States. You would be reporting directly to the Lead, Candidate Experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This is an anticipated 6-month temporary contract position with the possibility of extension based on business needs. Compensation is paid on an hourly basis at $30.00 – $35.00 / hour.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll do...&lt;/h3&gt;",
